ather, it boasts 15 times the strength of standard PU, ensuring long-lasting performance while helping protect the planet.<\/p>","file_position":"right","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SOFT_YET_FIRM_BEST_OF_BOTH_WORLDS_rlcs.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_e8zHd8":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":[".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: linear-gradient(91.49deg, #e5611c -15.55%, #ff9662 122.08%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>SOFT YET SUPPORTIVE – <\/p><p>THE PERFECT BALANCE<\/p>","sub_title":"ULTRA-SOFT MEMORY FOAM","description":"<p>Why settle for stiff, uncomfortable foam when our upgraded ultra-soft memory foam offers superior softness and lasting resilience? It cradles you in cloud-like comfort while providing the perfect support, designed to keep you comfortable, focused, and supported for years to come.<\/p>","file_position":"left","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SOFT_YET_FIRM_BEST_OF_BOTH_WORLDS_rlcs_seat.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_axWaGA":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":[".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw; padding-bottom: 6.25vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: linear-gradient(91.49deg, #e5611c -15.55%, #ff9662 122.08%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>Upright or Reclined, <\/p><p>We’ve Got You Covered<\/p>","sub_title":"WIDE DESIGNED SEAT BASE","description":"<p>Engineered for every posture—whether upright, cross-legged, reclined, or leaning—our wider, more versatile seat base provides adaptive comfort that supports you in any position.<\/p>","file_position":"right","file_type":"image","file_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Upright_or_Not_We_ve_Got_You_rlcs.webp","video_url":""}},"img_with_text_simplicity_pbNbgH":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":[".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: linear-gradient(91.49deg, #e5611c -15.55%, #ff9662 122.08%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>Adjustable Lumbar Support<\/p>","sub_title":"INTEGRATED 4-WAY DYNAMIC LUMBAR SUPPORT","description":"<p>The lumbar support is the heart of any great gaming chair, and ours is exceptional. With adjustable height and depth, it ensures a perfect fit for your spine, delivering ultimate comfort and support. The backrest is enhanced with memory foam, offering even more softness and comfort while providing superior support for long gaming sessions.<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"video","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/YOUR_LUMBAR_HAS_FOUND_ITS_MATCH_rlcs.webp","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/YOUR LUMBAR HAS FOUND ITS MATCH rlcs.webm"}},"img_with_text_simplicity_qJhzrx":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":[".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: linear-gradient(91.49deg, #e5611c -15.55%, #ff9662 122.08%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>PRECISE ARM SUPPORT RELIEVE SHOULDER & ARM STRESS<\/p>","sub_title":"4-WAY DYNAMIC ARMREST","description":"<p>Our 4-Way Dynamic Armrests are engineered to support your natural posture, moving seamlessly in every direction to reduce stress on your muscles and joints. These armrests provide the perfect alignment to keep you supported and comfortable.<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"video","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PRECISE_ARM_SUPPORT_RELIEVE_SHOULDER_ARM_STRESS_rlcs.webp","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/PRECISE ARM SUPPORT RELIEVE SHOULDER & ARM STRESS rlcs.webm"}},"img_with_text_simplicity_GcnqNM":{"type":"img-with-text-simplicity","custom_css":[".img_with_text_simplicity {padding-top: 8.33vw; padding-bottom: 7.8125vw;}",".img_with_text_simplicity .img_with_text_simplicity_subtitle {background: linear-gradient(91.49deg, #e5611c -15.55%, #ff9662 122.08%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"specId":"","title":"<p>SNAP. SLIDE. RELAX<\/p><p>ADJUST WITH EASE<\/p>","sub_title":"UPGRADED DUAL MAGNETIC HEAD PILLOW","description":"<p>Our upgraded magnetic neck pillow with double magnets ensures a secure fit and effortless adjustment. Its ergonomic design provides targeted support, keeping your neck and shoulders relaxed, while staying perfectly in place throughout your gaming sessions, no matter how long!<\/p>","file_position":"bottom","file_type":"video","cover_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SNAP_SLIDE_RELAX_ADJUST_WITH_EASE_rlcs.webp","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/SNAP SLIDE RELAX ADJUST WITH EASE rlcs.webm"}},"img_with_text_box_simplicity_xHQGVc":{"type":"img-with-text-box-simplicity","blocks":{"file_with_text_G7aHxJ":{"type":"file_with_text","settings":{"title":"Versatile Comfort","sub_title":"135° Backrest Recline","description":"Built for gaming, lounging, napping, and more. Adjust to any position effortlessly with a simple lever pull and push.","file_type":"video","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/rlcs 155° Backrest Recline.webm"}},"file_with_text_inBCzK":{"type":"file_with_text","settings":{"title":"Maximized Relaxation","sub_title":"14° Rocking Mode","description":"Find your perfect gaming stance with our multi-tilt mechanism. Adjust tension, lock your angle, and play in ultimate comfort.","file_type":"video","video_url":"","url_upload":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/rlcs 13° Rocking Mode.webm"}},"file_with_text_HXmhgR":{"type":"file_wit