"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"1. What makes the Athena Pro RLCS Edition gaming chair special?","content":"<p>The Athena Pro RLCS Edition is an officially partnered gaming chair created in collaboration with the Rocket League Championship Series, featuring exclusive RLCS design elements and tournament-inspired details.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_treTt8":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"2. What makes the RLCS Edition different from the standard Athena Pro chair?","content":"<p>The RLCS Edition offers the same ergonomic structure and performance engineering as the Athena Pro, but includes exclusive RLCS branding, collectible design accents, and a limited-edition aesthetic created for Rocket League fans and competitive players.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_J4gVqa":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"3. Is the RLCS Edition suitable for both gaming and office use?","content":"<p>Absolutely. While designed for esports performance, its ergonomic design and supportive structure also make it suitable for daily work, streaming, and general home office use.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_EJVUiq":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"4. What materials and build quality does the chair use?","content":"<p>The chair features a full steel frame, upgraded KGS class-4 gas lift, durable base, and premium memory foam cushioning, offering stability, durability, and long-lasting structural support.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_zCYi9z":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"5. Is assembly required, and how long does it take?","content":"<p>Yes, basic assembly is required. Most users can complete setup in 15–30 minutes using the included tools and instructions.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_eHtM3N":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"6. Does the chair come with a warranty?","content":"<p>The Athena Pro RLCS Edition comes with a 3-year gaming chair warranty as standard. By joining the <a href=\"\/pages\/warranty-extension\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty Extension\">Extend Warranty Program<\/a>, coverage can be extended up to 5 years for added long-term protection.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}}},"block_order":["content_QrKDTp","content_treTt8","content_J4gVqa","content_EJVUiq","content_zCYi9z","content_eHtM3N"],"custom_css":[".faqs-item {border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-family: Roboto;}",".collapsible-grid__item {border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6;}",".collapsible-content {width: 100%; padding: 0 18.75vw;}",".halo-block-header {padding: 0 18.75vw;}",".halo-block-header h3 {font-family: Roboto; font-weight: 700;}",".card-body {color: #646669; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400;}","@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {.collapsible-content {padding: 0 5.33vw; } .halo-block-header {padding: 0 5.33vw; }}"],"settings":{"id_section":"faq","container":"fullwidth","padding_full_width":50,"mg_top_desktop":100,"mg_top_tablet":50,"mg_top_mobile":40,"mg_bottom_desktop":100,"mg_bottom_tablet":50,"mg_bottom_mobile":40,"collapsible_bg":"#ffffff","collapsible_bg_gradient":"","collapsible_title":"FAQ","color_title":"#000000","fontsize_title":32,"fontsize_title_mb":24,"collapsible_des":"","color_des":"#3c3c3c","fontsize_des":16,"fontsize_des_mb":12,"max_width_des":700,"title_align":"left","enable_image_right":false,"bg_content_color":"#ffffff","title_color":"#000000","content_color":"#000000","icon_color":"#000000","border_color":"#000000","font-size_heading":16,"font-size_content":16,"font-size_content_line-height":22,"font-size_heading_mb":12,"font-size_content_mb":12,"font-size_content_line-height_mb":18}},"1743652201516533c4":{"type":"apps","disabled":true,"setti